udvm-m: x / y and x % y, for x from 0 to 999 and y from 1 to 999.
Cells 65-98. To call it, put y in cell 88, load x into the accumulator and JMP 65.
It returns the quotient x / y in the accumulator and the remainder x % y in cell 87.
It overwrites its own cells and cell 99; y in cell 88 is kept.
Size 34 cells. It runs at most 1,178 instructions, 28.6 on average, counted from cell 65 to the return jump in cell 98.
Exact over the domain.

